  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Hi, how's it going?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:44:36.569530+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Hi! I've been good, how about you? It must have been a busy week!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:45:28.296498+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What is the weather like in your area?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:45:55.214867+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear about the weather. It must have been terrible. I hope everything is getting better now.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:46:23.233211+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that the weather is terrible! That must be very tough. Are you taking care of yourself?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:48:33.534121+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, it must have been tough. I hope everything is getting better now.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:54:54.618317+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, that's terrible. Have you taken care of yourself?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:56:52.492831+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I have taken care of myself.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T21:59:09.752511+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, I'm so glad to hear that.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:07:27.817204+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's great to hear! What are you doing this weekend?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:10:21.884040+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I'm glad to hear that. What are you doing this weekend? I was actually thinking of going hiking.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:11:06.395863+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's great to hear! What do you plan to do this weekend? I would love to join you if it's safe and pleasant for both of us. If there are any specific trails or spots we could visit, please let me know, so I can make the arrangements.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:14:33.348174+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I am planning to go hiking this weekend! What about you? Any specific trails or spots in mind?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:17:03.861668+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That sounds like a great plan to go hiking! I think I'll take you up on that suggestion. What are your preferred trails, and what kind of weather conditions are you looking for?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:18:40.520622+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'd love to join you if it's safe and pleasant for both of us. Could we find a time that works for you both?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:32:02.209763+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Absolutely! What do you prefer hiking in? I like going on hikes that are moderately challenging and not overly strenuous. Sometimes I'd also like to explore more trails or even go camping somewhere. What about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:41:51.979765+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "It sounds like you have a lot of options when it comes to hiking, Olivia. Do you prefer more rugged trails or scenic spots? And what kind of weather conditions are you looking for?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:45:26.477942+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What about you? Any preferences or suggestions for trails?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:51:22.691643+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you so much for your suggestions, Olivia!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:56:07.759269+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks, I appreciate them so much.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:59:13.758973+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What do you want to do this weekend? I was actually thinking of going hiking.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T23:00:55.496804+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure thing! I love hiking when it's sunny. What do you like to hike and what's your favorite trail?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T23:48:20.109843+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I'm interested in trying some different trails. What's your favorite trail?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T23:50:24.057691+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I like to go on trails that are moderately challenging but not overly strenuous. Sometimes I also prefer to explore more trails or even go camping somewhere.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-07T23:59:31.542439+00:00"
    }
